    <string name="insulin_migration_default_used" comment="Shown once after the database migration when no profile was active, so the insulin actually used could not be determined. %1$s is the substituted insulin name, e.g. Ultra-Rapid-Oref. The already migrated records are NOT corrected later.">Older records had no insulin configuration and no profile was active, so %1$s was used for them. Check your insulin settings — already migrated records are not updated afterwards.</string>
    <string name="insulin_migration_default_dia_used" comment="Shown once after the database migration when the insulin was known but its duration (DIA) was not. %1$.1f is the duration in hours, e.g. 9.0, %2$s is the insulin name, e.g. Lyumjev. The already migrated records are NOT corrected later.">Older records had no insulin duration, so %1$.1f hours was used for %2$s. Check your insulin settings — already migrated records are not updated afterwards.</string>
    <string name="settings_unreadable_title">AAPS settings cannot be read</string>
    <string name="settings_unreadable_key_explanation">Your settings on this phone are encrypted with a key that Android keeps for AAPS, and that key does not open them any more. This can happen after the key store of the phone was reset.</string>
    <string name="settings_unreadable_keystore_explanation">The key store of the phone did not answer, so AAPS could not open its settings.</string>
    <string name="settings_unreadable_not_running">AAPS is not running and does not control the pump. A temporary basal that is running ends at its time, and then the pump gives its own basal.</string>
    <string name="settings_unreadable_what_to_do">Retry closes AAPS and starts it again. If that does not help, restart the phone. Choose Start fresh only when nothing else helps: it sets the unreadable settings aside, and AAPS starts with empty settings. Then import your last settings export in the setup wizard.</string>
    <string name="settings_unreadable_start_fresh">Start fresh</string>
    <string name="settings_unreadable_confirm_title">Start with empty settings?</string>
    <string name="settings_unreadable_confirm_text">The unreadable settings file is renamed and kept. All settings start from their defaults. Then you set up AAPS again or import a settings export.</string>
    <string name="settings_unreadable_notification">AAPS is not running. Open AAPS to see what to do.</string>

